  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Live events has been a great form for community to join up and get together. Ghostclub and Shelter are primary examples of how big these events are getting within the community\nI see a huge demand for online concerts in VRC as these events are instantly full when they go live. \nIt would be a waste not to help out and start making these mainstream in VRC. Having mirror instances on top of the worlds list were players can join and experience a crowd\nVRC has already shown interest getting extra compute power just to help offest IK data and the attempts to increase the player caps for these events. It is already becoming a staple feature of the weekends here but a majority of playerbase is not aware or don't have social media to learn about these events. Adding Live events to the world list would be a definite factor in helping promote these events.\nVRC has alreadt done events like this before similar to New Years, but only managed by VRC employees.\nWe should use VRC as a platform to boost community managed venues as a weekly events for players to interact and visit in from the top of the world's list. Even if it isn't the main event, fact is that these gatherings are some of the greatest thing VRCHAT has to offer in the middle of the quarantine and even after.",
